{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus","text":"I haven't seen a pilgrim for thousands of years!","uri":"fa213f89f7797d1c313bd6d21888f56f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus","text":"Pathetic fool! Prepare to die!","uri":"77732ae3c90d36a493866ea1f2b51516.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus","text":"Temple is closed!","uri":"640200e31fb77264750cff64afdf6020.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus","text":"Who dares to enter the Temple of Ikov!","uri":"d72b42add7dc43d8e1ca9f6c358817b4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus","text":"Your puny weapons do nothing against me human! Come back when you can give me a real fight!","uri":"f10a7da1642b910cfd6c82d5c3e6a484.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"An agent of evil cannot be allowed to leave!","uri":"3aa46aa19766a780885c6b47d763e00b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Armadyl is the god we serve. We have been charged with guarding his sacred arctifacts until he requires them.","uri":"4bf7a00274214e2ac6c038c939ddcf4a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Do not fear! We are devoted to our charge!","uri":"770a517ece3ebb37f46ed93206339934.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Fool! You will die for your sins!","uri":"77047da4e6dbae55077a3d60352ce8ef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Go in peace.","uri":"fa9ca323e145eadeabc89be0bac4eab3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Halt! You will not leave here with the Staff of Armadyl!","uri":"93ee5628316a01ec0bcb7f0e6f3453ec.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Hast thou come across the undead necromancer? It was he that raised an army of the undead against Varrock a generation ago. If you know where he is you can help us defeat him.","uri":"01b4c61dc095ebfa37a563cb79cd10dc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Have you killed Lucien?","uri":"80e50c70bccb926ec33c3dc23b4d745f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"He must be gaining in power again. If you can defeat him he will be banished from this plane for a while. You will need this pendant to attack him.","uri":"22364f0bb1ada286e69815c023028c50.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Hurry friend! Time is against us!","uri":"0df982e11b25a4766c158144055ca048.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"I may be a fool but I will not step aside!","uri":"a7739123a9cf24deb03ea83fb867f5f1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Linger a while and be at peace.","uri":"7d456255e0835269a5c2645753fe7bf0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Lucien must not get hold of the staff! He would become too powerful!","uri":"6e93040ea781dfddff847974b3afcc81.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"No! I am not old! My family has guarded the staff for many generations.","uri":"ce98f605ad83eec2b573ae77f8e539cb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Only members of our order are allowed to handle the staff.","uri":"a61cff211964d70cb61e44d0b1589a7f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Saradominists. Bleh. They only acknowledge those three. There are at least twenty gods!","uri":"407f59b0341827ab7b538017d1b318e0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"So he is close by?","uri":"287cb856d48ba8a0e6d1673ff7fe6ebe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Some still have presence in this world in their liche forms. Mahjarrat such as Lucien and Azzanadra would become very powerful if they came into possession of the Staff of Armadyl.","uri":"70610cbaa580559ba779337b2c8d5f8c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"That is a wise decision. Stay a while and let your soul be cleansed!","uri":"c559c4422bf2a91a5ceaf21cced35e95.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"The staff is sacred! You will not have it!","uri":"55d58d853786c5fe3b2e3ad9a18f5867.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"They are ancient and powerful beings! They are very evil! It is said that they once dominated this plane of existence, Zamorak was supposedly of their blood. They are far fewer in number now.","uri":"024cada15e87b7acfd6147c7fc7ab078.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Thou art working for that spawn of evil?! Fool! You must be cleansed to save your soul!","uri":"0280c7b64785b76dbb681879cd525b8a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Thou hast ventured deep into the tunnels, you have reached the temple of our master. It is many ages since a pilgrim has come here.","uri":"b85761ffec856329b09c8f06748bbf49.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Thou is a foul agent of Lucien! Such an agent must die!","uri":"1e9295b5a0904ce2a4c250d7a3823f42.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"We are the Guardians of Armadyl. We have kept the temple safe for many ages. The evil in the dungeons seek what lies here. The Mahjarrat are the worst.","uri":"a87e327ceaf81640189591e9fe3336df.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"We are the guardians of the staff, our fathers were guardians and our fathers' fathers before that. Why dost thou seek it?","uri":"2e6fb620896c0144f815c6a0015598e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"We must cleanse the temple!","uri":"dcb40b0908567f1093014a3622efbb6b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"You are a fool to be working for Lucien! Your soul must be cleansed to save you!","uri":"bb7007fe9b93f4ac0573dd427bd666c3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"You have been cleansed!","uri":"d5352f15fa190131c2beffd6b1e74582.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Guardian of Armadyl","text":"Your worldly greed has darkened your soul!","uri":"0cc1316bba08bb69854e0c6a3e0d6871.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Have you got the Staff of Armadyl yet?","uri":"674e29f5cce832f5e63d558d01f12e13.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Here is my pendant. Now, I cannot stay here much longer. Meet me in my house, across the river south-east from Edgeville. It is next to the so-called Grand Exchange.","uri":"2898faa429e38826650b3b88c634c9be.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Hmph.","uri":"20888e93c31d0e7f1caab1b7901cdac7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I can feel the power of the staff running through me! I will be more powerful and they shall bow down to me!","uri":"e09e26e7134ade5baeb2fbdb787b7deb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I need the Staff of Armadyl. It's in the Temple of Ikov, near Hemenster, north east of here.","uri":"59b3c5b3afc2a22c97660080d9d065a8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I require the Staff of Armadyl. But if you wish to seek it for me, you must free up some inventory space so that I can give you what you need.","uri":"87958d0d3c7917892a3ec94854173121.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I require the Staff of Armadyl. It is in the deserted Temple of Ikov, near Hemenster, north east of here.","uri":"fb3d395abb53f59c4dc548618198f064.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I see you are the mercenary type.","uri":"42f55f6cd11a6ee2d557a209f666f62b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I seek a hero to go on an important mission!","uri":"26db549abf419f2bef4ef1831ef88f40.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I shall give you a pendant. Without it you will not be able to enter the Chamber of Fear.","uri":"e7ca6d3919cb88b1c45c23b2cabd9a32.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I suppose you want your reward? I shall grant you much power!","uri":"0febd39389c82aa05f4b4d5ab1f19a86.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I told you not to meet me here again! Soon I will go to my house, across the river south-east from Edgeville. It is next to the so-called Grand Exchange.","uri":"6b3f7baa3ac45016735fde0651c171e8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"I will reward you well if you bring me the staff.","uri":"55618f9d2bc9d1361c6a248638a7eeef.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Imbecile!","uri":"8576a305728d42e33debb1f4ba8786ca.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"It's not as easy as it sounds. The monster can only be killed with a weapon of ice. There are many other dangers.","uri":"579e518ba1fd8ba6acdb327d1a0992d4.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Muhahahhahahaha!","uri":"f7a223ebfb9efbb50df735198153bb17.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"My patience grows thin hero!","uri":"05a5d1b2c7cff73c89901d4d6cb37336.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Take care hero! There is a dangerous monster somewhere in the temple!","uri":"5c013de588fd3e52ce141463f75cfee5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"The guardians of the Staff of Armadyl fear me!","uri":"2443673e4060866dcc6c018e889e1643.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"They have set up a magical barrier which even my power cannot overcome!","uri":"0c0f1598cf8689440a15f6e980a87b09.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"Wimp! Call yourself a hero?! My daughter is more of a hero than you!","uri":"8c412f38275e3faa10ba62607ef9ba9c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"You don't want to attack me. I am your friend.","uri":"87438f923789eb0be00bfab22d9c962d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Lucien","text":"You have defeated me for now! I shall reappear in the North!","uri":"8b6b86bc23293b4b89c7ebd25d3d612d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"A humble pilgrim.","uri":"b13f5d4c65a77307f905fbb34d02303c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"A mighty hero!","uri":"223d2583c8052ceaaf0341251f438264.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"Ah ok, thanks.","uri":"41ef91e46ab67475c68a1af4145e5eeb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"Did you say Lucien? It was Lucien that asked me to get the staff!","uri":"47b33219be8331cedbbe6445e6c87f9b.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"Give it to me!","uri":"2c2734778568b1ecf6648fda5c7a2fc7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"Hi again. Could you do the honours again please?","uri":"6eb02b296c0f6c3a58f722c93c95b7e8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"How dare you call me a fool! I will work for whom I want!","uri":"b288f600e297aa76efbbccf65df8d214.mp3"}
{"quest":"Temple of Ikov","character":"Player Female","text":"How many did you need again?","uri":"79ded99246031037282be25863995a45.mp3"}
